.","Regular, please.",1],[0,"Muy bien, magna.","Okay, regular.","274b90d92d7c",1.63],[0,"¿Se lo lleno, o cuánto le pongo?","Should I fill it up, or how much?","21d18a06f05f",1.95],[-1,"Sí, por favor.","Yes, please.",1],[0,"¡Qué bueno!","Good to hear!","353a9fa6e997",1.78],[-1,"¿Cuál me recomienda?","Which one do you recommend?",1],[0,"Para casi todos los carros, la magna está bien.","Regular's fine for almost any car.","d089992be5dd",3.31],[-1,"Con tarjeta, por favor.","Card, please.",1],[0,"¿Cuál le pongo, entonces?","Which one, then?","ad6f80ce54fc",1.33],[-1,"¿Me puede pasar corriente?","Could you give me a jump?",1],[0,"Claro, se la inflo para que llegue al taller.","Sure, I'll pump it up so you can get to the shop.","b014ef380bf5",3.32],[0,"¡Hasta luego! ¡Que le vaya bien!","See you! All the best!","a910ed601817",1.85],[0,"¡Nos vemos!","See you!","f25fd496e3c4",0.89],[0,"¿Y cuánto le pongo?","And how much should I put in?","a0f55ff7422e",1.18],[0,"Hay un taller mecánico sobre la calle Itzamná, ya saliendo del pueblo.","There's a mechanic on Itzamná Street, right where you leave town.","418c3c14c024",4.38],[0,"Con gusto.","Sure thing.","6d6bd9b6493b",1.02],[-1,"¿Cómo llego a la carretera?","How do I get to the highway?",1],[0,"Saliendo, a la izquierda, y en la calle Itzamná, otra vez a la izquierda: esa calle sale a la carretera.","Turn left as you leave, then left again at Itzamná Street: it takes you out to the highway.","2089454eb583",7.96],[0,"Muy bien, diésel.","Okay, diesel.","27c21defbff5",1.48],[-1,"Quédese con el cambio.","Keep the change.",1],[-1,"Lleno de magna, por favor.","Fill it up with regular, please.",1],[-1,"¿Aceptan tarjeta?","Do you take cards?",1],[-1,"No, así estoy bien, gracias.","No, I'm good, thanks.",1],[0,"Gracias.","Thank you.","7237e86636bb",1.22],[-1,"¿Puedo pagar con tarjeta?","Can I pay by card?",1],[0,"Premium, perfecto.","Premium, perfect.","6c8fabcf7ff9",1.4],[0,"Claro. Voy por los cables.","Sure. I'll go get the cables.","b43